      "paragraph_id": "p003",
      "start": 49,
      "end": 77,
      "surface": "陸平原東南之秀，王文度獨步江東，吾得比蹤昔人，何所多恨。",
      "kind": "quoted_speech",
      "speaker_role": "wangyun",
      "addressee_role": null
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "p003",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 185,
      "surface": "昔蔡伯喈見王仲宣稱曰：『王公之孫也，吾家書籍，悉當相與。』僕雖不敏，請附斯言。自謝朓諸賢零落已後，平生意好，殆將都絕，不謂疲暮，復逢於君。",
      "kind": "quoted_speech_with_nested_historical_report",
      "speaker_role": "shenyue",
      "addressee_role": "wangyun"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "p003",
